 35CL3cG unless otherwise noted.                                                
 35CL cG RI$From (p,|g), unless otherwise noted.                                
 35CL cG M,MR$From |g(|q) and/or |g|g(|q) in (p,|g) for |g rays originating from
 35CL2cG low-spin levels (J<9/2) and from |g|g(|q)(DCO) and |g(lin pol) in      
 35CL3cG ({+28}Si,|ap|g) for |g rays originating from high-spin (J|>9/2) levels,
 35CL4cG unless otherwise noted. Magnetic/electric characters are determined    
 35CL5cG based on |g(lin pol) or RUL with measured T{-1/2}, unless otherwise    
 35CL6cG noted. For primary |g transitions from proton resonances where widths  
 35CL7cG or resonance strengths are provided in (p,|g), a D+Q with definite     
 35CL8cG |d(Q/D)>0 from |g(|q) is firmly assigned as M1+E2. This assignment is  
 35CL9cG due to the fact that for these resonances, the proton width |G{-p} is  
 35CLAcG dominant over |G{-|g} and thus the total width |G is much greater than 
 35CLBcG |G{-|g}. The total width |G typically falls within the same scale as   
 35CLCcG the resonance strength, usually a few eV in the {+34}S(p,|g) dataset.  
 35CL cG E(X),RI(X)$Primary transitions probably from the unresolved 7501+7503  
 35CL2cG doublet initial levels in 1976Me12 in (p,|g)                           
 35CL cG E(Y),RI(Y)$Primary transitions probably from the unresolved 7837+7839  
 35CL2cG doublet initial levels in 1976Me12 in (p,|g)                           
 35CL cL E$Most of adopted levels are reported in (p,|g) dataset with precise   
 35CL2cL E(level) values, deduced based on measured |g-ray energies which       
 35CL3cL however are not reported in references in (p,|g) dataset, while        
 35CL4cL E(level) values from E|g values with uncertainties in other datasets   
 35CL5cL are less precise and the numbers of |g rays are much less than that of 
 35CL6cL (p,|g) datasets. Therefore, a least-squares fit to available E|g values
 35CL7cL with uncertainties would not produce E(level) values more precise and  
 35CL8cL complete than those already reported in (p,|g) and the evaluators have 
 35CL9cL adopted E(level) values from (p,|g) or averages of values based on E|g 
 35CLAcL data from all available datasets where applicable, as noted.           
 35CL cL J$For proton-resonance levels populated in (p,p):resonances, J|p       
 35CL2cL assignments are from R-Matrix analysis, unless otherwise noted         
 35CL cL J(Z)$From FRESCO-DWBA analysis of measured |s(|q) of (|a,p) (2019Se09) 
 35CL cL J(A)$ From angular distributions in {+31}P(|a,p):resonances.           
